---

<Layout title="About Us">
    <div class="hero container">
        <div class="content">
            <h1>
                We go <b>beyond</b> what the market considers.
            </h1>
            <h3>
                We were born from the combination of practical experience,
                creativity, and a healthy obsession with technology that truly
                transforms.
            </h3>
        </div>
        <div class="esfera-img-wrapper">
            <video
                src="/videos/sobre-nos/sobre-nos-esfera.webm"
                class="esferaImg"
                autoplay
                loop
                muted
                playsinline
                poster={EsferaImg.src}
            >
            </video>
        </div>
        <Icon name="arrow-down" class="arrow-down" />
    </div>

    <div class="missao container-boxed">
        <Badge text="Our mission" />

        <h2 class="typewriter-text">
            Our DNA combines years of experience in major corporations with a
            restless mindset that never accepts "that's how it's always been" as
            an answer.
        </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="problemas container-boxed">
        <h2>We like hard problems. <b>Really.</b></h2>
        <p>
            <b> We grow with challenges, and our clients reap the results.</b>
            We are passionate about solving problems no one wants to tackle, creating
            new ways to do old things, and using technology as a tool for real transformation.
        </p>

        <div class="blocks-img-wrapper">
            <video
                src="/videos/sobre-nos/sobre-nos-blocks.webm"
                class="blocksImg"
                autoplay
                loop
                muted
                playsinline
                poster={SobreNosBlocks.src}></video>
        </div>

        <h4>
            Here, digital transformation isn't a nice speech.
            <b>It's daily practice.</b>
        </h4>
    </div>

    <div class="jeito-transformatech container-boxed">
        <div
            class="jeito-inner"
            style={`background: linear-gradient(270deg, #070921 0%, rgba(0, 51, 113, 0.70) 100%), url(${logoSmoke.src}) no-repeat -10% center / contain, #0C111D;`}
        >
            <div class="jeito-content-inner">
                <h2>The <b>Transformatech</b> way of working</h2>
                <br />
                <p>
                    We are a restless company, passionate about technology,
                    obsessed with valuing talented people, and driven by the
                    desire to transform the world.
                </p>
                <br />
                <p>
                    We believe in long-term relationships. In partners who grow
                    with us. In projects that strengthen businesses, people, and
                    trust at the same time.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="marquee-container">
                <div class="marquee-column">
                    <div class="marquee-track-1">
                        {
                            [...marqueeColumn1, ...marqueeColumn1, ...marqueeColumn1, ...marqueeColumn1].map((img) => (
                                <Image src={img} alt="Transformatech Team" />
                            ))
                        }
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="marquee-column" style="margin-top: -60px;">
                    <div class="marquee-track-2">
                        {
                            [...marqueeColumn2, ...marqueeColumn2, ...marqueeColumn2, ...marqueeColumn2].map((img) => (
                                <Image src={img} alt="Transformatech Team" />
                            ))
                        }
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="felicidade container-boxed">
        <div class="felicidade-img-wrapper">
            <video
                src="/videos/sobre-nos/negocio-da-fecilidade.webm"
                class="felicidadeImg"
                autoplay
                loop
                muted
                playsinline></video>
        </div>
        <div class="felicidade-content">
            <h2>
                We are in the business of <b>happiness</b>.
            </h2>
            <p>
                It may seem unusual for a technology company, but this is a
                conviction that guides our work. Behind every system, there are
                people who depend on technology to operate better.
                <br />
                <br />
                At Transformatech, we develop solutions for professionals seeking
                more efficiency, less rework, and more predictability in their daily
                work.
                <br />
                <br />
                Our goal is simple: to create more stories of operational success
                than technical frustration.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="empresa-nao-cabe-em-caixa container-boxed">
        <div class="content">
            <h2>A company that <b>doesn't fit in a box</b>.</h2>
            <h3>
                Transformatech isn't just technology, consulting, automation, or
                data. It's all of this together, organized into solutions that
                solve real problems.
                <br />
                <br />
                We are always changing, creating, testing, and evolving.
                <br />
                That's why it's hard to define us in a single sentence.
            </h3>
        </div>

        <div class="cubo-img-wrapper">
            <video
                src="/videos/cubo-hero.webm"
                class="cuboImg"
                autoplay
                loop
                muted
                playsinline
                poster={CuboImg.src}></video>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="worldmap container-boxed">
        <div class="map">
            <Image src={worldmapImg} alt="" class="worldmapImg" />
            <Image src={mapPin} alt="" class="mapPin" />

            <Image src={mapPin} alt="" class="mapPinUSA" />
            <Image src={mapPin} alt="" class="mapPinEuropa" />
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <h2><b>Borderless.</b> Purpose-driven.</h2>
            <p>
                We operate in Brazil, the United States, and Europe, and we
                continue to expand. To us, borders are just lines on a map.
                <br />
                <br />
                We grow with a clear goal: to bring real impact to as many clients
                as possible, building relationships based on results, trust, and well-told
                stories.
            </p>
            <div class="badges">
                <BadgeFlag text="Brazil" image={brazilFlag} />
                <BadgeFlag text="USA" image={euaFlag} />
                <BadgeFlag text="Europe" image={europaFlag} />
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="nossotime container-boxed">
        <Badge text="Our team" />
        <h2>
            A restless team, passionate about transforming
            <b> complex challenges into results.</b>
        </h2>

        <div class="desktop-only">
            <div class="team-grid">
                {teamMembers.map((member) => <TeamCard {...member} />)}

                <div class="join-us-card">
                    <Image src={logoSmoke} alt="" class="join-us-logo" />
                    <div class="join-us-content">
                        <div class="text">
                            <h3>Want to join our team?</h3>
                            <p>
                                We're always looking for restless, technical
                                people committed to turning complex challenges
                                into real solutions.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="join-us-btn">
                            <ButtonArrowWhite text="Contact us" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mobile-only">
            <CarousselTeam>
                {
                    teamMembers.map((member) => (
                        <div class="embla__team__slide">
                            <TeamCard {...member} />
                        </div>
                    ))
                }
            </CarousselTeam>

            <div class="join-us-card">
                <Image src={logoSmoke} alt="" class="join-us-logo" />
                <div class="join-us-content">
                    <div class="text">
                        <h3>Want to join our team?</h3>
                        <p>
                            We're always looking for restless, technical people
                            committed to turning complex challenges into real
                            solutions.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="join-us-btn">
                        <ButtonArrowWhite text="Contact us" />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="parceria container">
        <div class="container-boxed">
            <div class="content">
                <h2>More than a project. <b>A partnership.</b></h2>
                <h3>
                    Tell us where you want to go. <br />
                    We will help you design the way.
                </h3>
                <span class="button">
                    <ButtonArrowWhite
                        text="Bring Transformatech to my business"
                    />
                </span>
            </div>

            <div class="parceiros-img-wrapper">
                <video
                    src="/videos/sobre-nos/parceiros-transformatech.webm"
                    class="parceiros-img"
                    autoplay
                    loop
                    muted
                    playsinline
                    poster={ParceirosImg.src}></video>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        import { gsap } from "gsap";
        import { ScrollTrigger } from "gsap/ScrollTrigger";

        gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);

        document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
            let mm = gsap.matchMedia();

            mm.add("(min-width: 601px)", () => {
                const tl = gsap.timeline({
                    scrollTrigger: {
                        trigger: ".hero",
                        start: "top top",
                        end: "+=150%",
                        scrub: 1,
                        pin: true,
                    },
                });

                tl.to(".hero .content", { opacity: 0, y: -100, duration: 1 })
                    .to(".arrow-down", { opacity: 0, duration: 0.2 }, "<")
                    .to(".esfera-img-wrapper", { y: "-40vh", duration: 1 }, "<")
                    .fromTo(
                        ".missao",
                        { opacity: 0, marginTop: "5vh" },
                        { opacity: 1, marginTop: "-50vh", duration: 0.8 },
                        "-=0.8",
                    );
            });

            mm.add("(max-width: 600px)", () => {
                const tlMobile = gsap.timeline({
                    scrollTrigger: {
                        trigger: ".hero",
                        start: "top top",
                        end: "+=120%",
                        scrub: 1,
                        pin: true,
                    },
                });

                tlMobile
                    .to(".hero .content", { opacity: 0, y: -50, duration: 1 })
                    .to(".arrow-down", { opacity: 0, duration: 0.2 }, "<")
                    .to(".esfera-img-wrapper", { y: "-20vh", duration: 1 }, "<")
                    .fromTo(
                        ".missao",
                        { opacity: 0, marginTop: "5vh" },
                        { opacity: 1, marginTop: "-30vh", duration: 0.8 },
                        "-=0.8",
                    );
            });
        });
    </script>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function () {
            const elements = document.querySelectorAll(
                ".mapPin, .mapPinUSA, .mapPinEuropa",
            );

            const observer = new IntersectionObserver(
                (entries, observer) => {
                    entries.forEach((entry) => {
                        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
                            entry.target.classList.add("animate");
                            observer.unobserve(entry.target); // 👈 faz rodar só uma vez
                        }
                    });
                },
                {
                    threshold: 0.3,
                },
            );

            elements.forEach((el) => observer.observe(el));
        });
    </script>
</Layout>
